WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.396
Guys, guys, guys! Check it out!

00:00:01.396 --> 00:00:03.899
I got the original dart board from Cheers on eBay!

00:00:03.899 --> 00:00:05.776
It only cost a hundred thousand dollars!

00:00:05.776 --> 00:00:06.818
I'm going to put it up.

00:00:06.818 --> 00:00:09.488
Hey, I thought Korvo said no more throwing metal in the house

00:00:09.488 --> 00:00:11.573
after you got that butter knife stuck in his eye.

00:00:11.615 --> 00:00:13.116
These are famous darts!

00:00:13.116 --> 00:00:14.993
Whatever Korvo doesn't know won't hurt him.

00:00:14.993 --> 00:00:15.660
Watch this!

00:00:16.036 --> 00:00:16.661
Whoops!

00:00:16.661 --> 00:00:17.287
Oh my God!

00:00:17.287 --> 00:00:19.080
You hit Korvo in the throat, Terry!

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:20.665
Oh my God!

00:00:20.665 --> 00:00:22.751
Go get the voice-fixing ray.

00:00:23.001 --> 00:00:24.085
I'm sorry, big guy.

00:00:24.085 --> 00:00:24.753
My bad.

00:00:24.753 --> 00:00:26.379
We'll get this fixed in a jiffy.

00:00:29.466 --> 00:00:31.468
I told you not to throw metal around here.

00:00:31.468 --> 00:00:32.427
We're going to be late to work.

00:00:32.427 --> 00:00:33.804
Stop buggering about!

00:00:34.679 --> 00:00:36.598
Hey does Korvo sound a little off?

00:00:36.598 --> 00:00:38.725
This thing must not be calibrated, let me try again.

00:00:38.725 --> 00:00:39.267
No!

00:00:39.851 --> 00:00:41.895
No, this is working for me.

00:00:41.895 --> 00:00:42.979
Alright, chop chop!

00:00:42.979 --> 00:00:44.022
Let's get a move on!

00:00:44.022 --> 00:00:44.940
I hate being late.

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:46.441
It makes me feel hot and weird.

00:00:46.441 --> 00:00:48.235
You make me feel hot and weird.

00:00:48.235 --> 00:00:48.819
What was that?

00:00:48.819 --> 00:00:49.528
Nothing!

00:00:49.528 --> 00:00:50.529
Coming, sweetie!

00:00:51.404 --> 00:00:54.115
Wait, is his voice just going to be like that from now on?

00:00:54.115 --> 00:00:56.117
Yeah, but it sounds pretty much the same to me.

00:00:56.117 --> 00:00:57.118
Nobody's gonna notice.

00:01:01.581 --> 00:01:03.959
Planet Schlorp was a perfect utopia...

00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:06.711
...until the asteroid hit.

00:01:06.711 --> 00:01:08.421
One hundred adults and their replicas

00:01:08.421 --> 00:01:09.881
were issued a pupa and escaped

00:01:09.881 --> 00:01:11.216
into the space,

00:01:11.216 --> 00:01:12.300
searching for new homes

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:13.844
on uninhabited worlds.

00:01:13.844 --> 00:01:15.011
We crashed on Earth,

00:01:15.011 --> 00:01:17.430
stranding us on an already overpopulated planet.

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:17.848
That's right.

00:01:17.848 --> 00:01:19.099
I've been talking this whole time.

00:01:19.099 --> 00:01:20.308
I'm the one holding the pupa.

00:01:20.308 --> 00:01:21.142
My name is Korvo.

00:01:21.142 --> 00:01:21.893
This is my show.

00:01:21.893 --> 00:01:23.562
Bollocks, I just dropped the pupa.

00:01:23.562 --> 00:01:24.437
This is ridiculous.

00:01:24.437 --> 00:01:26.356
I hate Earth. It's a horrible home.

00:01:26.356 --> 00:01:28.108
People are stupid and confusing.

00:01:28.108 --> 00:01:29.484
This is what my voice sounds like now.

00:01:29.484 --> 00:01:31.319
I don't care if it's jarring. Get over it.

00:01:31.319 --> 00:01:33.238
And that voice-changer ray had chronotons in it

00:01:33.238 --> 00:01:35.282
so this is what I'm going to sound like in flashbacks, too.

00:01:35.323 --> 00:01:36.825
You got a problem with that? Then tough s***.

00:01:36.825 --> 00:01:37.951
It's called science.

